# Admin auth

- Gate admin pages/APIs with existing `requireAdmin` / `isAdminEmail` and middleware matcher for `/admin`.
- Never add temporary auth bypasses, hardcoded admin emails in client code, or alternate admin cookies.
- Keep privileged actions (download, complete, delete, Packeta, notify) in `app/api/admin/**`; do not move them to client-only logic.
- Use `supabaseAdmin` only on the server; browser/client Supabase must stay on the publishable key.
- Preserve redirect-to-login behavior for unauthenticated or non-admin users.
- Do not log full order payloads or customer PII in admin tooling.
